  m_text: "<align=center><b><color=red>-A\xE7\u0131klama-</color></b></align>\r\nProjede
    4 adet uzmanl\u0131k alan\u0131na sahip olan doktorlar\u0131n tart\u0131\u015Fmas\u0131n\u0131
    izleyeceksiniz.\r\n<color=red>1 -</color> A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki alanlara hangi
    uzman\u0131n nas\u0131l bir karakteristik \xF6zelli\u011Fe sahip olaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    se\xE7iniz.\r\n<color=red>2 -</color> Yan taraftaki alana tart\u0131\u015Fma
    konusunu girdikten sonra butona basarak tart\u0131\u015Fmay\u0131 ba\u015Flat\u0131n\u0131z."
